        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Account Manager/Service drive adoption and outcome: onboarding/training (links to VS-43.3), service activation (links to VS-12/VS-47), issue resolution (links to VS-13.1/VS-90), and value-engineering; ensure the customer realizes the promised value
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Service
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
