      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Top-tier account; strategic milestone; relationship gap (W3429)
Frequency: Per cadence + event-driven
Volume: Top ~50–100 accounts
Owner: Executive Sponsor
Participants: Sponsor (C-suite/VP), Account Manager, Customer C-suite, Marketing/Events (links to VS-14)
Source: workflow W3438 — Executive-to-Executive Engagement &amp; C-Suite Relationship Programs</bpmn:documentation>
