      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: KAP/JBP (W3427); co-marketing opportunity
Frequency: Opportunity-driven
Volume: Selected strategic accounts
Owner: Account Manager
Participants: Account Manager, Marketing (links to VS-14), CSR (links to VS-25/VS-135), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Customer marketing
Source: workflow W3439 — Joint Marketing, CSR &amp; Co-Marketing with Strategic Accounts</bpmn:documentation>
