      <bpmn:userTask id="W3439_Task5" name="Account Manager/Marketing identify joint-marketing/CSR opportunities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager/Marketing identify joint-marketing/CSR opportunities: co-branded campaigns (links to VS-14.1), trade/industry events (links to VS-104.2), case-study/testimonial, sustainability/CSR partnership (links to VS-25/VS-135), and referral/reference; align to brand guidelines (links to VS-14.3/VS-100.2)
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Marketing
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3439_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3439_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
