Responsible (R): Marketing / Legal
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management / CMO
Duration: Per activity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3439_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3439_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3439_Task7" name="Account Manager/Marketing measure joint-marketing ROI and brand impact, capture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager/Marketing measure joint-marketing ROI and brand impact, capture the customer reference/case-study for sales reuse (links to VS-14/VS-13), and feed outcomes to the KAP (W3427) and QBR (W3430)
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Marketing
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per activity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3439_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
