    <bpmn:process id="W_W3440" name="W3440. Strategic Account Innovation, Feedback &amp; Co-Creation Loop" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer feedback/need; innovation cycle (links to VS-30)
Frequency: Continuous + innovation cycle
Volume: Top strategic accounts as innovation partners
Owner: Account Manager
Participants: Account Manager, Innovation/Product (links to VS-30/VS-01.1/VS-41), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Customer
Source: workflow W3440 — Strategic Account Innovation, Feedback &amp; Co-Creation Loop</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3440_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3440_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3440_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3440_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3440_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3440_Lane2" name="Innovation">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3440_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3440_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3440_Start4" name="Customer feedback/need; innovation cycle (links to VS-30)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3440_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3440_Task5" name="Account Manager capture structured customer feedback/needs (product gaps…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager capture structured customer feedback/needs (product gaps, service improvements, innovation ideas) from the QBR (W3430), success management (W3437), and CX (links to VS-13.1/W87); route to Product/Innovation (links to VS-30/VS-01.1) and Private Label (links to VS-41)
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3440_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3440_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3440_Task6" name="Innovation/Merchandising co-create with select strategic accounts: pilot new…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Innovation/Merchandising co-create with select strategic accounts: pilot new products/services (links to VS-01.1 NPI, VS-41 private label, VS-30.1 PoC), test in the customer context, and refine; offer early-access/partnership benefits
Responsible (R): Innovation / Merchandising / Customer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising / CIO
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3440_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3440_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3440_Task7" name="Account Manager close the loop: communicate outcome back to the customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Account Manager close the loop: communicate outcome back to the customer, credit co-creation, and roll out the validated innovation; capture the win in case-studies (W3439) and the KAP (W3427); measure innovation contribution to account growth
Responsible (R): Account Manager / Innovation
Accountable (A): Head of Strategic Accounts
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3440_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3440_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3440_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3440_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-551 (ensure controlled execution — Enterprise Account Growth, Contract &amp; Executive Engagement (PA-107.2).) | - operational: routing and loop-closure; operational: scoped pilots and expectation management
Owner: Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
